repository-code: "https://github.com/srinath-chanda/orbital-propagation-research-core"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible Python framework for comparing analytical two-body,
  numerical two-body, J2, simplified-drag, and fixed-TLE SGP4 propagation in
  low Earth orbit, with recorded GMAT validation evidence.
keywords:
  - orbital propagation
  - low Earth orbit
  - J2 perturbation
  - SGP4
  - GMAT validation
